{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "patches": [
    {
      "name": "Fix hardcoded title fonts",
      "description": "Makes views that are hardcoded to Product Sans or Roboto (toolbar titles, settings screen titles, theme preview, drawer header, search box, URL views, voting and comment chips, onboarding buttons and more) use the title font of the post view mode the user is currently in.\n\nList / Compact / Smaller cards / Small cards / Cards / Slide each have their own title font setting (\"*_font_title\") and this patch routes all hardcoded title typefaces through those settings.\n\nTargets Sync for Reddit / Sync Pro / Sync Dev v23.06.30-13:39.",
